==Swedish==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmq-osw|sv}} {{term|lang=gmq-osw|kviker}}, {{term|lang=gmq-osw|kvikker}}, from {{etyl|non|sv}} {{term|lang=non|kvikr}} (whence also Norwegian ''[[kvik]]'' and ''[[kvikk]]'', Icelandic and Faeroese ''[[kvikur]]''), from {{etyl|gem-pro|sv}} {{m|gem-pro|*kwikwaz}}, whence also English ''[[quick]]''. Ultimately from {{etyl|ine-pro|sv}} {{m|ine-pro|*gʷih₃wós||alive}}.

